<title>CROATIA: Croatia May real wage index 110 vs 109.9 in April.</title>
<headline>Croatia May real wage index 110 vs 109.9 in April.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.  CROATIA NET WAGES		  MAY	APRIL    MAY '96</p>
<p> Real wage index (base 1996)   110.0     109.9     101.3</p>
<p> Nominal wages (HRK)	     2,361     2,313     2,067</p>
<p> -Goods, services sector	 2,329     2,266     2,036</p>
<p> -Public services		  2,447     2,443     2,149 NOTE -</p>
<p>nominal wages before June 1994 have been converted to Kuna from the temporary Croatian dinar currency at 1,000 dinars to one kuna. -- Zagreb newsroom +385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
